`tools.json` has `qux` 1.0.0 and `zed` 1.0.0. Each has its data file `<name>.exe` and its bin dir entry `<name>.exe` (the same text, so the entry is Talon's, R-ST11). `talon/x/` has the entries of acme/foo 1.1.0 (not installed), acme/qux 2.0.0 and acme/zed 2.0.0. The fake `rename` says `Exists` for a target that ends with `bin/zed.0123456789abcdef.del`.

